WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.530 --> 00:00:07.930
Welcome to Sahaaya. It helps you check who you are paying, before you pay.

2
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:15.360
Tap Scan & Pay, then point the camera at the shop’s QR code.

3
00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:21.790
A saved shop: same account as always. This matches your saved shop; it is not a bank check.

4
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:27.820
Type or say the amount. It is shown in words, so an extra zero is easy to spot.

5
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.550
Final check: the shop, the account and the exact amount. Tap “Yes, pay” only if it is right.

6
00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:42.210
Your UPI app opens. Your UPI PIN goes only into that app. Sahaaya never asks for it.

7
00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:47.840
A new shop is not checked yet. Read the name and the amount carefully.

8
00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:57.740
Your helper can check a new shop or a big payment and send an approval code. Pay stays locked until then.

9
00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:06.020
Stop! The name is your saved shop, but the money goes to a different account. Don’t pay. Ask the shop.

10
00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:13.330
In Easy settings: bigger text, voice, vibration, or silent mode with text instead of sound.

11
00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:20.300
Take your time. You can go back or cancel at any step.
